      "w": 400,
      "text": "Like the contacts app on your phone: you tap 'Mum', and the phone dials her number. You never type the number.\n\nYour laptop checks its own hosts file first, then asks a DNS server. A made-up name gets 'NXDOMAIN': no such contact."
    },
